      "role": "user",
      "content": "uhhh... that's a bit weird. the email looks more like a list than an actual message to a customer. it's kind of a mess at the end too. \n\ncan you try again? please make it sound like a real, professional email from a human, not just a list of features. and please don't just copy-paste the whole list like that—it's super spammy. just use the score as a guide to make sure you mention the important stuff, but focus on making it actually persuasive so they want to log back in.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Welcome Back! Discover the New Features of FlowState CRM\n\nHi [User Name],\n\nWe hope this message finds you well. We noticed your absence from FlowState CRM and we genuinely miss seeing your innovative spirit and growth within our platform. We’re excited to tell you all about the new features in FlowState CRM that have been inspired by your feedback and designed to reinvigorate your love for CRM.\n\nSince your last login, FlowState CRM has grown into a more potent tool with both powerful automation and tailored customizations. Just imagine an enhanced experience driven by advanced features, all tailored to your unique workflow.\n\nFlowState now boasts smarter, seamless online and mobile access to help you keep being on top of your game. Our newly implemented pipeline management and real-time lead scoring systems cut through the noise and place the right opportunities right at your fingertips. With the latest enhancements, you are better prepared than ever to manage client interactions efficiently.\n\nWe also understand the importance of staying connected with your teams. That's why we’ve refined our team collaboration tools for a more vibrant and dynamic experience. Alongside this, FlowState CRM also includes more robust email management with our updated smart notification system and mobile app access continuing to ensure you stay in sync no matter where",
